// The nine neural models of Mercury, from the Mercury pedal of the FunBox project (https://github.com/GuitarML/Funbox, MIT licence, Copyright (c) 2024 Keith Bloemer; model_data_nam.h).
// They are "pico" models, an unofficial size of the Neural Amp Modeler (https://github.com/sdatkinson/neural-amp-modeler): a Nano model with 2 channels in the first layer array instead
